 IP
address and a port number</span><span style=3D'font-size:15.0pt;color:#7030=
A0'>,</span><span
style=3D'font-size:11.0pt'> uniquely identifying an endpoint for communicat=
ion on
a network.<br />
<br />
</span>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;margin-left:.375in'><img
