ernet Message Access
Protocol)</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;margin-left:.375in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.=
0pt'><span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0 </span>* 443: HTTPS (HT=
TP Secure)<br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;margin-left:.375in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.=
0pt'><span
style=3D'font-weight:bold;color:#C00000'><span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>=
=C2=A0=C2=A0
</span>* Registered Ports (1024-49151): </span><span style=3D'font-weight:b=
old;
color:black'>These are also</span><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;color:#C0=
0000'>
assigned by IANA</span><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;color:black'> but</s=
pan><span
style=3D'font-weight:bold;color:#0070C0'> for specific applications and ser=
vices,
often proprietary ones.<br />
</span><span style=3D'color:black'>(</span><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;
color:black'>Proprietary</span><span style=3D'color:black'> --&gt; Propriet=
ary
