:bold'>Layer 4
(Transport): </span><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;color:#C00000'>TCP/UDP =
ports,
handling of segments.</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;margin-left:.375in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.=
