<p style=3D'margin:0in;margin-left:.375in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.=
0pt'>Okay,
this is a very common point of confusion, and it's essential to understand =
the
concept of layers in networking.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;margin-left:.375in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.=
0pt'>Think
